# 4. PHASE 1 — MULTI-QUERY DENSE RETRIEVAL

Start with ONLY the existing Qdrant medical index and dense retrieval.

Do NOT add BM25 yet.

Do NOT add a cross-encoder yet.

Do NOT rebuild the medical index.

Do NOT re-embed the corpus.

Generate a small number of short clinical retrieval queries from the existing `query_plan()` concepts.

Maximum:

```text
4 queries per patient case
```

Process queries sequentially.

For each query:

```text
query
 ↓
BGE-small-en-v1.5
 ↓
existing Qdrant medical_knowledge
 ↓
Top-20 candidates
```

Deduplicate candidates after retrieval.

Then inspect whether useful medical evidence is recovered.

Only after Phase 1 is stable should additional retrieval components be introduced.

