# 6. DENSE RETRIEVAL

Continue using the existing BGE embedding infrastructure initially.

Do not replace the embedding model yet.

For Phase 1 use:

```text
candidate_k = 20
```

Do NOT begin with 50 or 100.

The existing Qdrant index should be queried directly.

Do not materialize the entire medical collection into Python memory.

Do not load all medical chunks just to perform dense retrieval.

