      ↓
local reranker
      ↓
Top-5
```

NOT:

```text
Top-100
      ↓
cross-encoder
      ↓
Top-5
```

Start with one query/case at a time.

Do not batch many cases.

Do not run concurrent reranking.

Prefer a lightweight local reranker appropriate for a 16 GB RAM CPU-first environment.

Before installing or loading a reranker, inspect:

* model size
* RAM requirement
* whether it runs CPU-only
* expected inference cost

If the reranker is likely to cause excessive memory pressure, STOP and report that before implementing it.

Do not silently install a large model.

