The text used for retrieval may contain contextual information such as:

```text
title
section heading
document topic
chunk text
```

But the actual evidence passed to downstream agents must remain faithful to the source.

Do not fabricate or rewrite medical evidence merely to improve embedding quality.

Maintain:

```text
retrieval_text
```

separately from:

```text
evidence_text
```

while preserving:

* source ID
* title
* section
* original text
* source
* provenance
* metadata
* similarity/ranking information

